  "history": [
    {
      "date": "2026-04-27",
      "description": "Added the level 7 Recall Spell. Reduced upgrade times at levels 3 to 6: Level 3: 8d 12h -> 7d 12h. Time Level 4: 9d 12h -> 8d. Time Level 5: 11d 12h -> 9d. Time Level 6: 12d 12h -> 11d. Time Recall Spell now will prioritizes Heroes."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-04-27",
      "description": "召回目标改为优先选择英雄。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://supercell.com/en/games/clashofclans/blog/release-notes/the-sound-of-clash-update/",
      "sourcePublishedOn": "2026-04-27"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-08-31",
      "description": "修复召回单位重新部署后卡在城墙内或城墙附近的问题。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://supercell.com/en/games/clashofclans/blog/release-notes/august-update-3/",
      "sourcePublishedOn": "2026-08-30",
      "dateSourceUrl": "https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Diggy?oldid=625147#History"
    }
  ],
  "facts": [
    "The Recall Spell is the eighth spell unlocked when the Spell Factory is level 7, requiring the Town Hall to be at least level 13.",
    "For this purpose, Heroes and Pets are considered to take up 25 and 20 housing space respectively, the latter with some exceptions:"
  ],
